+# TLS backend
+
+No decision on the TLS backend is currently recorded for this project. The project's recorded decisions do cover TLS usage in general (https everywhere, with no exceptions, and certificate verification on all builds), but none of them selects a TLS backend, so this document does not name one. It should be updated once a backend decision is made and recorded.
